# Keep the working tree LF on every platform.
#
# biome.json pins lineEnding to "lf" and `npm run verify` runs `biome check .`, so without
# this a Windows checkout (core.autocrlf=true by default) fails the linter on every file
# before the contributor has changed anything.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
